# The repository uses LF everywhere; a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would otherwise
# turn generated files (such as the dark theme CSS) into CRLF and break the up-to-date checks.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
